<h2 class='greeting'>Hi {{username}}! 🔄</h2>

<p class='message'>
  New backup codes have been generated for your ChatApp account. Your previous backup codes are no
  longer valid.
</p>

<div class='security-note'>
  <h3>📋 Your New Backup Codes</h3>
  <p>Save these new backup codes in a safe place:</p>
  <div
    style='background: #f8fafc; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 8px; margin: 1rem 0; font-family: monospace;'
  >
    {{#each backupCodes}}
      <div style='padding: 0.25rem 0;'>{{this}}</div>
    {{/each}}
  </div>
  <p><strong>Important:</strong> Your old backup codes no longer work.</p>
</div>